content.text:
The fault is in `geo`: its container crash-looped and was not ready, so `search` could not reach it and every search request failed back to the user. I did not find any other root cause.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "geo",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name, metric, count(*) n, min(value) mn, max(value) mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric IN ('k8s.container.restarts','k8s.container.ready') AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'geo%' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Geo pod restarts rose to 3-6 and container ready was 0 throughout the abnormal window."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='geo' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Geo emitted no server spans in the abnormal window, against 1161 in normal."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, message, count(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='search' AND level='ERROR' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Search logged 'Failed to get nearby hotels from geo service' about 1533 times in the abnormal window."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "geo",
      "to": "search",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name='geo.Geo/Nearby' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4", "claim": "Search's geo.Geo/Nearby client calls returned Error 1133 times in the abnormal window, versus none in normal."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "search",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('search','frontend') AND span_name IN ('search.Search/Nearby','HTTP /hotels') AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4", "claim": "Search server errors (1133) propagated to frontend search client errors and frontend HTTP /hotels 500 responses (1099)."}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

